Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.78,0:00:15.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, Greed's dead, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.01,0:00:19.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, and in a certain way, \Nthe way he died was just right for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.44,0:00:24.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unsightly yet beautiful in its violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.04,0:00:28.57,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,Well, even if one of us is lost, \Nyou-know-who will just make another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.57,0:00:33.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, we've located a new Wrath. \NRight now, Sloth has him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.51,0:00:36.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder what we should \Nmake him do...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.46,0:00:38.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.77,0:00:42.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're getting all sentimental over Greed dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.96,0:00:44.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.92,0:00:47.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something just crossed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.91,0:00:51.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where do we come from, and where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:53.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a load.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.64,0:00:54.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Patrons...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.74,0:00:57.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd like to close \Nthe restaurant soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.67,0:00:59.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're alive here, now....
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.39,0:01:01.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen, sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.18,0:01:02.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...and we don't \Nneed to go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.18,0:01:04.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.74,0:01:06.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you listening to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.02,0:01:11.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.97,0:01:15.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I eat him? Can I eat him?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.19,0:01:17.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Today, it's my treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.63,0:01:18.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.38,0:01:28.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.17,0:01:30.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've wondered about this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.02,0:01:33.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where did I come from, and where am I going?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.12,0:01:44.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay with me! \NStay with me, Jimmy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.03,0:01:47.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me! \NPlease let me through!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.95,0:01:50.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, let me \Ntake a look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.33,0:02:09.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He'll be all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.26,0:02:11.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.89,0:02:20.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lust...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.45,0:02:22.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lujon...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.90,0:02:37.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything \Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.64,0:02:42.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything, \Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.90,0:02:47.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's \NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.63,0:02:53.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that \Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.00,0:04:37.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, are you sure \Nthis road is the right one?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.76,0:04:41.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're definitely \Nheading south in any case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.00,0:04:44.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll come upon the \NIshbalan camp before long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.06,0:04:45.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.35,0:04:52.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But will you actually learn anything from asking the Ishbalans?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.28,0:04:54.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't have any other leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.60,0:04:58.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I don't want to be manipulated by those homunculus guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.80,0:05:00.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.31,0:05:02.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just now...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.76,0:05:05.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought I heard \Na woman scream...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.39,0:05:21.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lujon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.24,0:05:26.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.92,0:05:30.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For crying out loud... Here you are, springing up right on time...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.60,0:05:32.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that, you little runt?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.58,0:05:36.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.07,0:05:48.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's been two years, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.53,0:05:51.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I never thought \NI'd see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.67,0:05:54.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have so many things \NI want to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.72,0:05:58.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But before that, I wonder \Nif you would tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.56,0:06:01.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did you disappear \Nfrom before me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.96,0:06:04.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did you leave \Nwithout a word?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.87,0:06:07.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't remember. \NIt was so long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.97,0:06:12.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I remember! \NYou taught me so many things!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.76,0:06:16.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alchemy and something even more important.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.93,0:06:21.12,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,What are you doing here? \NYou've never set foot outside of the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.12,0:06:24.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, I'm looking \Nfor a new Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.69,0:06:26.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You remember, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.41,0:06:31.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks to this Stone that you gave me, \Nour village was saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.29,0:06:33.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that disease has \Nbroken out again,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.50,0:06:37.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and this Stone's power \Nseems to have gotten weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.54,0:06:38.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.41,0:06:42.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will you lend me \Nyour help again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.38,0:06:45.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once more, \Nlike you did before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.00,0:06:52.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A mudslide, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.24,0:06:54.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This sure is quite a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.34,0:06:57.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I eat them? Can I eat them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.12,0:07:00.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop doing that. \NYou should go on a bit of a diet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.47,0:07:07.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lucky girl, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.45,0:07:12.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here... Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.27,0:07:17.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deliver these herbs to the village. Everyone is waiting for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.30,0:07:22.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Over there! There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.21,0:07:24.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.64,0:07:26.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Libia... Libia!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.38,0:07:29.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay with me, Libia!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.66,0:07:32.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Lujon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.19,0:07:33.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Here...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.35,0:07:37.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you not to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.47,0:07:39.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This stuff won't \Ndo us any good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.64,0:07:43.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised. You guys must've been riding in the carriage too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.77,0:07:47.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even so, you'd best get away \Nfrom here as soon as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.89,0:07:51.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fossilitis is spreading \Nthroughout this whole area.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.25,0:07:52.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fossilitis?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.53,0:07:53.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll cure it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.74,0:07:58.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to \Ncure this with my...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.35,0:08:00.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,with my alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.28,0:08:10.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, you're traveling by yourself in order to find this man Lujon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.36,0:08:11.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.48,0:08:14.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know what \Nyour reasons are,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.14,0:08:17.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but it's really not good for a woman to be out alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.70,0:08:19.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.27,0:08:21.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.23,0:08:24.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With the way things are going, I get the feeling that I'll never see Lujon again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.40,0:08:28.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, why did this Lujon guy leave your village?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.80,0:08:31.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He left to search for \Na new Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.79,0:08:33.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Philosopher's...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.02,0:08:34.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...Stone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.97,0:08:39.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.52,0:08:43.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to cure the \Nfossilitis in our village,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.70,0:08:47.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,he needs the power of the Stone, \Nno matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.97,0:08:52.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is a terrible disease, \Nwhich no medicine has any effect on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.60,0:08:55.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which is the reason why Lujon...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.28,0:09:03.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here, drink this. \NIt will help you to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.69,0:09:05.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.58,0:09:09.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From the looks of it, you weren't \Nhurt that badly, for which I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:11.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,L-Libia!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.03,0:09:13.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? \NAre you really hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.86,0:09:17.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay. My hand \Njust slipped a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.28,0:09:20.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lujon! Lujon, are you here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.68,0:09:23.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My son... My son...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.46,0:09:29.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is fossilitis.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.55,0:09:34.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The body suddenly begins changing into something like stone or dry wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.83,0:09:39.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,People die, almost like \Nthey are withering flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.60,0:09:45.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave this boy, all that which is bringing calamity upon him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.00,0:09:47.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vasilisa, hear the cries of this boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.60,0:09:50.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vasilisa, hear the grief of this boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.07,0:09:53.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vasilisa, please accept this boy's prayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.78,0:09:56.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The enemy shall all be put to shame \Nand flee in terror.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.34,0:10:00.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They shall withdraw at once and be reproached.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.50,0:10:08.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.88,0:10:13.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anji... Anji!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.42,0:10:18.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He had... He had only \Njust turned eight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.78,0:10:36.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.05,0:10:41.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't do anything! \NAll I can do is pray to God!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.57,0:10:46.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vasilisa, my god, \NI ask that with your power,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.54,0:10:48.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you please spare the little ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.52,0:10:50.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please spare her!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.53,0:10:53.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, God... \NIshbala, my god...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.75,0:10:55.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I ask that with your power,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.77,0:10:57.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you would please \Nspare this little one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.46,0:10:59.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please spare them...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.37,0:11:08.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're trying to use alchemy to \Ntake the dead parts of the body
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.01,0:11:11.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and reconstruct them back into a normal body, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.39,0:11:15.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that medicine won't work, \Nyou are not mistaken in your thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.39,0:11:19.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, you don't have \Nenough experience with alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.55,0:11:23.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will teach you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.47,0:11:26.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,true alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.59,0:11:42.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.68,0:11:44.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who would've thought that you'd ever come to our village again?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.31,0:11:49.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told them that I left the village to \Nsearch for a new Philosopher's Stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.77,0:11:53.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but maybe I was \Nactually looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.44,0:11:56.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanted to see you again too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.36,0:12:00.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've had this feeling \Nfor the longest time
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.77,0:12:02.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that I left something \Nbehind in the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.11,0:12:07.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.82,0:12:10.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're heading in the same direction anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.07,0:12:11.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.77,0:12:15.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I'm not really sure it's right \Nfor me to go back to the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.09,0:12:16.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What choice do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.70,0:12:19.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You may be out looking, \Nbut you don't have any leads,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.00,0:12:20.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so there's not much else \Nyou can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.51,0:12:26.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By any chance, is this Lujon-san fellow your boyfriend, or anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.65,0:12:27.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.93,0:12:29.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,was dumped by him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.05,0:12:32.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been in love with him \Nfor a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.98,0:12:36.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the one he is \Nreally in love with is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.48,0:12:41.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the place where you did your training, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.53,0:12:45.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It does indeed look like you've at least got a lot of books together here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.87,0:12:49.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.20,0:12:53.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Most of this is junk. First, you have to acquire the correct knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.50,0:13:03.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Read these in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.06,0:13:06.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Drill it all into your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.45,0:13:15.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's no use. \NThis is too hard for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.37,0:13:16.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just can't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.46,0:13:20.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay. You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.99,0:13:24.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have the talent. \NCome on, believe in yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.84,0:13:40.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}There it is again...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.28,0:13:42.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.00,0:13:45.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why do I have these memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.39,0:14:16.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.87,0:14:20.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.20,0:14:25.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My gift to you. This Philosopher's Stone \Nwill increase your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.28,0:14:33.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't start off with trying to heal people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.36,0:14:37.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Try using your power to \Nreturn this bird to the skies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.21,0:14:44.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,May God save this creature \Nand watch over it, never slumbering.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.74,0:14:49.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Lord is this creature's keeper; the sun shall not smite it by day,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.63,0:14:52.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,nor the moon smite it by night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.87,0:14:56.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.65,0:15:04.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like I told you, \Nyou have the talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.51,0:15:08.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.44,0:15:10.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.37,0:15:22.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could I ask you one more time?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.67,0:15:26.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why did you disappear \Nfrom before me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.44,0:15:30.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You knew how I felt \Nabout you, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.07,0:15:43.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't go looking \Nfor all the answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.12,0:15:46.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It will end up \Nbeing your ruin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.83,0:15:49.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't understand. \NWhat are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.08,0:15:54.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, don't take Lujon... \NDon't take Lujon away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.72,0:15:57.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He and I are engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.52,0:16:00.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once my fossilitis is gone, we're getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.30,0:16:04.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that nice? \NCongratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.55,0:16:07.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you invite me to the ceremony, I'll give a speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.14,0:16:11.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please don't joke around! I'm being serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.56,0:16:25.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Libia,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.99,0:16:28.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will use my power \Nto heal you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.85,0:16:31.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,May God save this woman
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.61,0:16:33.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and watch over her, \Nnever slumbering.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.61,0:16:37.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Lord is this woman's keeper;
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.22,0:16:40.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the sun shall not \Nsmite her by day,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.53,0:16:43.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,nor the moon \Nsmite her by night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.58,0:16:56.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incredible... \NThat's incredible, Lujon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.03,0:16:57.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cure my wife too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.14,0:16:58.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take care of my kid too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.28,0:16:59.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You did it, Lujon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.06,0:17:08.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How is it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.93,0:17:13.14,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,Nothing to worry about. \NEverything is proceeding right on schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.14,0:17:14.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.49,0:17:18.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all, that's the whole reason why \Nwe intentionally introduced this illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.89,0:17:23.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lujon is starting to heal the disease with the fake Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.38,0:17:25.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that will only last \Nfor the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.81,0:17:30.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Next, I will take away \Nthe power that I gave Lujon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.27,0:17:33.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then he will fall into \Nthe depths of despair
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.12,0:17:37.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and start seeking out \Na genuine Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.59,0:17:39.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And he'll be doing it for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.78,0:17:42.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've been doing the same thing \Nall over the place,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.90,0:17:47.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,all to find us a person who can create a genuine Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.99,0:17:53.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.55,0:17:57.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Libia, you're even \Nprettier than usual today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.52,0:18:00.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, do you know \Nwhere Lujon is?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.24,0:18:02.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just about time for \Nthe ceremony to start, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.89,0:18:06.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't do it... \NI can't go through with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.59,0:18:10.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alchemy isn't the only thing that you taught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.32,0:18:12.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something \Neven more important.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.94,0:18:14.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder what that could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.39,0:18:21.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want you by my side forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.22,0:18:23.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.87,0:18:30.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who... Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.75,0:18:40.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'd better go to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.71,0:18:41.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.25,0:18:43.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.57,0:18:44.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lust...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.74,0:18:45.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.87,0:18:48.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Libia!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.32,0:18:55.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you sure about this? \NI'm afraid of Envy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.45,0:19:07.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're nearly at the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.97,0:19:10.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hang on, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.31,0:19:13.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With this new power...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.56,0:19:29.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Over here! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.95,0:19:31.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.51,0:19:38.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've saved us again,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.73,0:19:41.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,like you did two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.21,0:19:44.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.25,0:19:48.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That day, \Nwhen I hugged you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.05,0:19:54.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But this will be \Ndifferent from then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.92,0:19:56.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't let you go \Nthis time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.32,0:19:58.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.68,0:20:18.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.59,0:20:42.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You were my small...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.38,0:20:44.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,blemish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.01,0:20:50.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where did I come from, and where am I going?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.99,0:21:02.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lujon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.66,0:21:05.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lujon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.95,0:21:07.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lujon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.28,0:21:09.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lujon, where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.58,0:21:31.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.11,0:21:32.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Libia-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.01,0:21:39.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.25,0:21:41.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.96,0:21:44.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,what in the world is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.16,0:21:53.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey... Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.15,0:21:57.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lust, I'm hungry. Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.42,0:23:40.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.07,0:23:43.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 36: "The Sinner Within Us"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.37,0:23:47.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think that anyone would be scared to see this mechanical arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.00,0:23:48.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course they would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.32,0:23:49.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.53,0:23:52.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,your heart isn't \Nnecessarily always right.
